        "subject": "LU-20290 idl: Temporarily reserve OBD_CONNECT2_IRNID_REPLACE",
        "message": "LU-20290 idl: Temporarily reserve OBD_CONNECT2_IRNID_REPLACE\n\nReserve OBD_CONNECT2_IRNID_REPLACE flag value\n0x10000000000000ULL for servicenode discovery.\n\nAdd placeholder entries for connect flags not yet present in this\nbranch to preserve the correct flag-name table indexing.\n\nThis is a temporary copy of the upstream flag reservation,\nneeded until the corresponding changes are merged into master.\nIt can be dropped once the upstream reservation is available.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\n\nSigned-off-by: Serguei Smirnov <ssmirnov@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Id96df4a7f7d5613b7336c82e5d45f8e8d2233bb2\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
